  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "As it is now, if you're not in the same room, and you want to invite someone, you can't exactly do the normal formalities. \"Hey, how are you, wanna see my world?\"\n\nAnd then you get those invites and sometimes you're busy, and you want to explain why you can't join.  \n\nMy thoughts would be a second reject button, \"Reject with Reason\"  and would have a follow up menu, that lets you pick from some fairly basic options, as well as a custom message option as well.\n\n\"Busy\"\n\"With others\"\n\nand perhaps some other ideas that we can come up with.",
